The Canadian team's number 1 trio is ready to tackle the season.
Last night, the unit formed by Alex Kovalev, Tomas Plekanec and Andrej Kostitsyn drove the attack on the Panthers from Florida with a storm fire, resulting in a 3 to 2-victory.
